INSERT INTO events (seq, at, entity, event, detail) VALUES (304, '2026-07-26T01:56:28Z', '#63', 'set-status', 'Closed by commit ac2ba8b. The kebab-case rule and the S<number> grammar are applied to every identifier a corpus introduces, in both formats, on the declared and the referenced paths, above the --legacy branch; worklog add''s positional slug passes validateText. Evidence: make gates exit 0; internal/cli/testdata/import-identifiers.txtar, which is also this repository''s first md-table test; the coordinator reproduced the hostile import before the fix and the refusal after, and separately confirmed the payload tail no longer reaches stderr. The three doors this does NOT close are #71, #72 and #73, each filed with its reasoning.');
